msgctxt "200"
msgid "Phew... hah... (How can somebody that fat be so fast...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "(Damn. I guess I should head back to Kyushu No. 1 Star...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "So he got away..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Dammit. I know the owner said to forget about him, but I can't just ignore "
"what he did... I'll catch him next time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Guh... hah... You again? What's with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "I guess you never learn, huh? You're coming with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "That'll be 950 yen for the pork ramen you ate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"But I don't think we need your money. Instead, you're gonna wash our dishes "
"until closing time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"You gotta be kidding! What if I pay ten times the price? You can let me go "
"for 9,500 yen, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Wait, you've got that much!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"Please! Seriously, your ramen is amazing! Would that be enough to make it up"
" to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Well, for that much cash, how can I refuse?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Just... if you had that much money, why didn't you pay in the first place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Why did I dine and dash? Ha... hahaha..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "You should know by now. I did it because the food was there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"What!? You're not climbing Everest, you idiot! You don't just do it "
"\"because it's there\"!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "And you... You make a good rival. I'll see you next time I go dashing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"Thanks for catching that dine-and-dasher. You must be tired... Here, have a "
"drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Staminan Spark<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>uno Staminan Spark<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"Sorry you got wrapped up in this. Now that loon thinks you're his rival or "
"something. Well... good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"I trusted him to pay this time, but the bastard ran out on his bill again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"I knew he was the dine-and-dasher, but the owner insisted we don't "
"discriminate... and now look what happened!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"Hey, look over there! There he is! What the hell you looking at, bastard!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"Please! He's too fast! I can't catch up to him. Can you chase him down?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "I'll pay for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"This isn't about money, it's about the rules! It's about pride! It's about "
"the burning drive to defend our honor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Wait, you bastard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "Dammit! That lardass is too fast!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid ""
"Grrr! I don't care if the owner said to let him go⑬I can't let him get away "
"with this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "I'll get him next time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid "All right. I just need to catch him, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid ""
"You'll really chase him!? I owe you one. I don't really care about the "
"money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"The owner put his heart and soul into that ramen. I can't let somebody dine "
"and dash on us. Please, catch him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid ""
"You see what happens!? You eat the ramen, you damn well better pay for it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "Che è successo?"

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "That guy ran out without paying for his meal! Him, over there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "I can't believe that bastard! Has he gotten that far already!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid ""
"Dammit! The owner makes that ramen with pride! I can't let him disrespect us"
" like this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "I'll pay for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid ""
"This isn't about money, it's about the rules! It's about pride! It's about "
"the burning drive to defend our honor!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "Wait, you bastard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid "Dammit! That lardass is too fast!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1244"
msgid ""
"Grrr! I don't care if the owner said to let him go⑬I can't let him get away "
"with this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid "If he ever comes back, I'll destroy him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
